{
  "name": "Backup n8n Workflows to GitHub",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔁 Backup n8n Workflows to GitHub\n\nBacks up every workflow in your n8n instance to a GitHub repo every hour. New workflows are added, changed ones are committed, unchanged ones are skipped.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a GitHub repo (**private** recommended).\n2. In n8n, go to **Settings → n8n API**, create an API key, and add it as an **n8n API** credential on **Get All Workflows**.\n3. Add a **GitHub** credential to the three GitHub nodes. The token needs write access to the repo's contents.\n4. In those three GitHub nodes, replace `YOUR_GITHUB_OWNER` and `YOUR_REPO_NAME`.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\nFiles are saved as `workflows/<name>_<id>.json`.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0b7d3c1e-5f2a-4a8e-9c61-2d4f8e7a1b30",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "triggerAtMinute": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "632acd37-281c-41e5-bda9-30dce1812e6a",
      "name": "Every Hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "excludePinnedData": true
        },
        "requestOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "ccf87899-4f26-4026-89dd-17f2647bef45",
      "name": "Get All Workflows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.n8n",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        464,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "wf-id",
              "name": "workflowId",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "wf-name",
              "name": "workflowName",
              "value": "={{ $json.name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "file-path",
              "name": "filePath",
              "value": "=workflows/{{ ($json.name || \"untitled\").replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9 _-]/g, \"\").trim().replace(/\\s+/g, \"-\") }}_{{ $json.id }}.json",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "file-content",
              "name": "fileContent",
              "value": "={{ JSON.stringify($json, null, 2) }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "69213f76-359e-4f56-a164-b9fcf16de126",
      "name": "Prepare Backup File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        688,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ae6f985c-f119-4743-81fd-9e7cf321689c",
      "name": "Loop Over Workflows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        912,
        304
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "file",
        "operation": "get",
        "owner": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "YOUR_GITHUB_OWNER"
        },
        "repository": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "YOUR_REPO_NAME"
        },
        "filePath": "={{ $json.filePath }}",
        "asBinaryProperty": false,
        "additionalParameters": {}
      },
      "id": "24c9f0b4-d731-478e-9676-5d1f8ce740b2",
      "name": "Get Existing Backup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        320
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 1
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.content || \"\").replace(/\\n/g, \"\").base64Decode() }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              },
              "rightValue": "={{ $('Prepare Backup File').item.json.fileContent }}"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e52f0820-1837-490a-a2b5-c952ecb1bd68",
      "name": "Workflow Changed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1344,
        208
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "file",
        "operation": "edit",
        "owner": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "YOUR_GITHUB_OWNER"
        },
        "repository": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "YOUR_REPO_NAME"
        },
        "filePath": "={{ $('Prepare Backup File').item.json.filePath }}",
        "fileContent": "={{ $('Prepare Backup File').item.json.fileContent }}",
        "commitMessage": "=Update workflow: {{ $('Prepare Backup File').item.json.workflowName }}"
      },
      "id": "2a9943f1-cb79-4c6e-b818-fec7b85e73ee",
      "name": "Update Backup in GitHub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1568,
        192
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "file",
        "owner": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "YOUR_GITHUB_OWNER"
        },
        "repository": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "YOUR_REPO_NAME"
        },
        "filePath": "={{ $('Prepare Backup File').item.json.filePath }}",
        "fileContent": "={{ $('Prepare Backup File').item.json.fileContent }}",
        "commitMessage": "=Add new workflow: {{ $('Prepare Backup File').item.json.workflowName }}"
      },
      "id": "ce56cc72-2744-490a-bd9d-c44d43215e9c",
      "name": "Create Backup in GitHub",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1344,
        464
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Hour": {
